and a sharper hit on contact.</p><div class=\"spec\"><div><b>6.1mm</b><span>Shaft Dia.</span></div><div><b>Hard</b><span>Flex</span></div><div><b>32 Lbs</b><span>Max Tension</span></div></div><a href=\"https://in.hndrd.co/products/nitrix-70-venom\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"star cursor-target\" style=\"--sc:#22c55e;--sr:34,197,94\"><span class=\"bgb\"></span><span class=\"bgt\"></span><span class=\"inn\">Enter Attack Mode <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></span></a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"div\"></div>\n<section class=\"chap\" style=\"--ac:#3b82f6;--rgb:59,130,246;--gl:rgba(59,130,246,.15)\">\n  <div class=\"bg\"></div><div class=\"blur\"></div><div class=\"thread\"><i></i></div>\n  <div class=\"inner rev\">\n    <div class=\"copy\"><p class=\"ser\">Power Series</p><h2>Nitrix 70 Volta</h2><h3>Clean Power. Faster Swing.</h3><p class=\"desc\">Made for players who want crisp energy transfer, fast air cuts and a confident attacking rhythm.</p><div class=\"spec\"><div><b>7.0mm</b><span>Shaft Dia.</span></div><div><b>Flexible</b><span>Flex</span></div><div><b>32 Lbs</b><span>Max Tension</span></div></div><a href=\"https://in.hndrd.co/products/nitrix-70-volta\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"star cursor-target\" style=\"--sc:#3b82f6;--sr:59,130,246\"><span class=\"bgb\"></span><span class=\"bgt\"></span><span class=\"inn\">Enter Power Mode <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></span></a></div>\n    <div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"orb\"></span><img src=\"https://in.hndrd.co/cdn/shop/files/2_ab549237-062a-4026-8105-a47ab014588a.jpg?v=1752848941&width=900\" alt=\"Nitrix 70 Volta\"></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"div\"></div>\n<section class=\"chap\" style=\"--ac:#a855f7;--rgb:168,85,247;--gl:rgba(168,85,247,.15)\">\n  <div class=\"bg\"></div><div class=\"blur\"></div><div class=\"thread\"><i></i></div>\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"vis\"><spa